le2 CENSUS estimates of mRNA copies per cell, imported without renormalization or rounding; they are not raw read counts, UMI counts, CPM, or TPM.","The 146 profiles are individual cells, not 146 independent animals. Source animal/pool labels M3, M4 and M1-5, plates and Fluorogold labeling are retained for each cell.","All retained cells are annotated P25 in the authors' cellular annotation; GEO sample records describe P23. This discrepancy is retained rather than resolved by inference. The paper describes male mice, while per-cell annotation lacks sex. Feeding state is unreported. No group is eligible for the reference-only filter.","Source final CellType labels are preserved. They may differ from the provisional Cell_Type_guess and the Fluorogold labeling; those source fields are retained separately.","This expression-only reference supplies no differential-expression comparison, significance test, or cross-study mean."]}
